OL,3,GNEWSAThe challenge of selling a house
OL,4,Awith a dark past
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the heart of many grisly court cases
OL,7,Flie the properties in which the crimes
OL,8,Funfolded. Some are demolished, while
OL,9,Fothers still cast a shadow over the
OL,10,Fcommunities in which they stand. So how
OL,11,Fdo you go about selling a house where
OL,12,Fsomething terrible has happened ` and
OL,13,Fwho would buy it?
OL,15,FThe addresses of some notorious
OL,16,Fproperties seep into the public
OL,17,Fconsciousness.
