OL,3,GNEWSAThe challenge of selling a house
OL,4,Awith a dark past
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-five Cromwell Street in
OL,7,FGloucester ` where the bodies of nine
OL,8,Fgirls and young women, murdered by Fred
OL,9,Fand Rosemary West, were dug up ` is
OL,10,Fone.
OL,12,FThe house at 10 Rillington Place in
OL,13,FNotting Hill, west London, where John
OL,14,FChristie carried out his murders, and
OL,15,FIan Huntley's in Soham, Cambridgeshire,
OL,16,Fare others.
